[1396.371607, "o", "\r\nid   wrong change to the model                                            diff test proofs             detail\r\nM1   TypeId version mask loses a bit                                      caught    a proof fails      9414 disagreements\r\nM2   Damage::increase(UserDefined) sets bit 12 (what the callers expect)  caught    a proof fails      938 disagreements\r\nM3   strtoul does not skip white space                                    caught    proofs still pass  865 disagreements\r\nM4   two transition names swapped                                         caught    proofs still pass  2 disagreements\r\nM5   bufEnd check off by one                                              caught    a proof fails      46 disagreements\r\nM6   loop runs once more at remaining = 0                                 caught    proofs still pass  model does not finish in 300 s\r\nM7   remaining decreases by extent - 1                                    caught    proofs still pass  model does not finish in 300 s\r\nM8   root tests the wrong damage bit                                      caught    proofs still pass  832 disagreements\r\nM9   alloc aborts on an exact fit                                         caught    proofs still pass  3639 disagreements\r\nM10  extent read at the wrong offset                                      caught    a proof fails      9955 disagreements\r\nM11  int to size_t sign extension dropped                                 caught    a proof fails      1213 disagreements\r\nM12  datagram that exactly fits is refused                                caught    proofs still pass  1413 disagreements\r\nM13  stale header bytes replaced by zeros                                 caught    a proof fails      1825 disagreements\r\nM14  calls one more byte out of bounds than the code reads                caught    a proof fails      0 disagreements, 163 undefined-behaviour claims valgrind rejects\r\n\r\n14 mutants, 14 caught\r\n"]
